      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Moses alone shall come near to the LORD, but they shall not come near. The people shall not go up with him.”",
      "ko": "너 모세만 여호와에게 가까이 나아오고 그들은 가까이 나아오지 말며 백성은 너와 함께 올라오지 말찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e00da9123279c1226f342bcbee7c493be01cb8185e18555a300059a135ffbd9b",
      "translation_text_hash": "622c0e9e50f2f18a7a97579a14ed6a6dfa74f5bbed291081f1a314cc16cbe369",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
