      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "Moses took half of the blood and put it in basins, and half of the blood he sprinkled on the altar.",
      "ko": "모세가 피를 취하여 반은 여러 양푼에 담고 반은 단에 뿌리고",
      "source_text_hash": "9eaa56f9c76bdfb10fed366a8ffee12b06c31d9b467bddce05bbb1e7ec6fc77a",
      "translation_text_hash": "01a671f7a4a916d48424a4764baf0814a7689868ce5f5f388971fe74594e7cb1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "모세가 피를 취하여 반은 여러 양푼에 담고 반은 단에 뿌리고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "01a671f7a4a916d48424a4764baf0814a7689868ce5f5f388971fe74594e7cb1"
      ]
