        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "He took the book of the covenant and read it in the hearing of the people, and they said, “We will do all that the LORD has said, and be obedient.”",
      "ko": "언약서를 가져 백성에게 낭독하여 들리매 그들이 가로되 여호와의 모든 말씀을 우리가 준행하리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "14e1c5a95e745032599586926e5445e8cecf5bc474c5f38ea1e20f9a600bad04",
      "translation_text_hash": "e1378c6b2e331495b06ab0f8c866a4e870043c9679bed3c23576e5987161b173",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "언약서를 가져 백성에게 낭독하여 들리매 그들이 가로되 여호와의 모든 말씀을 우리가 준행하리이다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e1378c6b2e331495b06ab0f8c866a4e870043c9679bed3c23576e5987161b173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EXO:24:8",
      "sequence": 2186,
      "chapter_label": "EXO 24",
      "verse_label": "8",
      "locator": {
